      ],
      "source": "https://riversandsretreat.com/blog/uncovering-ehrenbergs-past-a-small-museums-big-impact-on-arizona-river-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ehrenberg’s Old Cemetery is one of the town’s most touching historical sites, reflecting early settlers’ lives.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://riversandsretreat.com/blog/uncovering-ehrenbergs-past-a-small-museums-big-impact-on-arizona-river-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The town’s economy once relied on mining, and remnants of historic mines still mark the landscape.",
